    "featured": false,
    "ai_summary_points": [
      "The Somali Council of Ministers approved a nine-member board for the Somali National Fisheries Company.",
      "The approval follows a proposal from the Ministry of Fisheries and Blue Economy and implements an October 2025 law.",
      "The board will oversee the company's efforts to develop Somalia's marine resources and combat illegal fishing.",
      "The decision may create economic opportunities for the Somali diaspora through investment and job creation."
    ]
